  https://github.com/yaml/go-yaml
  Copyright (c) 2011-2019 Canonical Ltd
  Copyright (c) 2006-2010 Kirill Simonov
  MIT license
  The YAML library of actionlint. crates/workflint-yaml reproduces its
  limits and error messages, so that workflint accepts and rejects the
  same files. go-yaml's NOTICE file places its internal/libyaml/ files,
  which hold that behaviour, under libyaml's MIT license, and their
  headers carry the copyright lines above. The comment scanning in
  crates/workflint-yaml/src/libyaml/scanner.rs is ported from the
  scanComments and scanLineComment functions of go-yaml's
  internal/libyaml/scanner.go. xtask/goyaml-dump builds the unmodified
  library to compare the two parsers.

